OL,3,GNEWSANHS gets #500m boost in Wales'
OL,4,Afirst budget under Plaid Cymru
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith no overall majority in the Senedd,
OL,7,Fthe party's Welsh government needs
OL,8,Fsupport from political opponents to
OL,9,Fapprove its tax and spending plans.
